        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Loneliness — Bilingual Study Notes</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: { inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']] }\n};\n</script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  html, body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #ffffff;\n  }\n  body {\n    font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;\n    color: #111;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 1.55;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 552px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 10px 8px 14px 8px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: row;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n  }\n  .main-col {\n    width: 396px;\n    padding-right: 10px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .side-col {\n    width: 148px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    border-left: 1px solid #cfcfcf;\n    padding-left: 8px;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n  }\n  .en {\n    margin: 0 0 1px 0;\n  }\n  .zh {\n    margin: 0 0 6px 0;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #7d7d7d;\n    display: block;\n  }\n  .zh.nounder {\n    border-bottom: none;\n  }\n  h2.sec {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin: 14px 0 1px 0;\n    text-decoration: underline;\n  }\n  .sec-zh {\n    margin: 0 0 6px 0;\n    font-weight: normal;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #7d7d7d;\n    display: block;\n  }\n  .hl-orange { background: #f7c88a; }\n  .hl-yellow { background: #fbf0a8; }\n  .hl-green  { background: #b9e6b0; }\n  .hl-pink   { background: #f7b6b0; }\n  .side-block {\n    margin-bottom: 12px;\n  }\n  .side-col p {\n    margin: 0 0 2px 0;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    border: 1px dashed #999;\n    color: #666;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"main-col\">\n    <p class=\"en\">Ask yourself what  loneliness  means to you.</p>\n    <span class=\"zh\">问问自己孤独对你意味着什么。</span>\n\n    <p class=\"en\">If you're telling yourself that  loneliness  is a terrible thing, that it's dangerous to alone, and that you can't fend for yourself in life, you have a problem.</p>\n    <span class=\"zh\">如果你告诉自己孤独是一件可怕的事情，孤独是危险的，你不能在生活中照顾自己，你就有问题了。</span>\n\n    <p class=\"en\">Therefore, you must change these  irrational  ideas for more <span class=\"hl-orange\">rational</span> and realistic ones.</p>\n    <span class=\"zh\">所以，你一定要把这些非理性的想法，换成更<span class=\"hl-yellow\">理性</span>、更现实的想法。</span>\n\n    <h2 class=\"sec\">Spend time with you</h2>\n    <span class=\"sec-zh\">与你共度时光</span>\n\n    <p class=\"en\">Force yourself to spend time alone.</p>\n    <span class=\"zh\">强迫自己花时间独处。</span>\n\n    <p class=\"en\"><span class=\"hl-green\">In order to</span> change, you must not only act on a <span class=\"hl-orange\">mental</span> or cognitive level, but also on a  behavioral  level.</p>\n    <span class=\"zh\">为了改变，你不仅要有<span class=\"hl-green\">精神</span>或认知层面上的意识，还要在行为层面上行动。</span>\n\n    <p class=\"en\"><span class=\"hl-orange\">Program</span> <span class=\"hl-yellow\">entire</span> weekends alone with your own company.</p>\n    <span class=\"zh\">计划<span class=\"hl-yellow\">整个</span>周末单独由自己陪着自己。</span>\n\n    <p class=\"en\">Enjoy a book or a movie if you want but avoid social media.</p>\n    <span class=\"zh\">如果你愿意，享受一本书或一部电影，但避免社交媒体。</span>\n\n    <p class=\"en\">Go to the movies, to the beach, to the mountains, alone.</p>\n    <span class=\"zh\">去看电影，去海滩，去山上，一个人。</span>\n\n    <p class=\"en\">Take a trip without any company.</p>\n    <span class=\"zh\">在没有任何陪伴的情况下进行一次旅行。</span>\n\n    <p class=\"en\">When you do this for long enough, you'll realize that you survived, that your fears weren't real, and that you've met your own true self and now you know yourself better.</p>\n    <span class=\"zh\">当你这样做足够长的时间后，你会意识到你幸存了下来，你的恐惧不是真的，你已经遇到了真正的自己，现在你更了解自己了。</span>\n\n    <h2 class=\"sec\">Connect with others</h2>\n    <span class=\"sec-zh\">与他人联系</span>\n\n    <p class=\"en\">Manage your time so you surround yourself with people.</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"side-col\">\n    <div class=\"side-block\">\n      <p><span class=\"hl-yellow\">rational</span>:adj.</p>\n      <p>〔人〕有理性的，理智的;能作出理智决定的，理性的</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"side-block\">\n      <p><span class=\"hl-yellow\">mental</span>:adj.精神状态的</p>\n      <p><span class=\"hl-green\">mental illness</span>;精神的; 思考的; 智力的</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"side-block\">\n      <p><span class=\"hl-yellow\">program</span>：n. 计算机〕程序：</p>\n      <p>V.计划；规划；安排</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"side-block\">\n      <p><span class=\"hl-yellow\">entire</span>:adj.</p>\n      <p>全部的; 整个的</p>\n      <p><span class=\"hl-green\">同义词：</span></p>\n      <p><span class=\"hl-green\">whole</span></p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"side-block\">\n      <p><span class=\"hl-pink\">为了…（目的）</span></p>\n      <p><span class=\"hl-pink\">短语：</span></p>\n      <p><span class=\"hl-pink\">in order to</span></p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"side-block\">\n      <p><span class=\"hl-pink\">so as to</span></p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"side-block\">\n      <p><span class=\"hl-pink\">so that</span></p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
